    "ART_PROMPT": "A blinding singularity of pure white light fracturing into a spectrum of colors against a deep void, nebulas forming in the distance, abstract and majestic style",
    "ABILITY_TEXT": "Shuffle your hand and Sheol into the Tower, then draw 7 cards.",
